WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.112
Step 2 reads the findings.

2
00:00:02.112 --> 00:00:04.537
Look for the account called gmsa ops.

3
00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:07.967
It's in Domain Admins,
SailPoint never aggregated it,

4
00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:12.912
and no request explains it: three findings
for one account nobody asked for.

5
00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.050
Step 3 reads what the
code hands to Chapter 6.

6
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.336
Two rows, one per approved request,

7
00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:22.662
each carrying its SailPoint
request and its ServiceNow change.

8
00:00:22.662 --> 00:00:26.169
The approved group managed
account gets its retriever group,

9
00:00:26.169 --> 00:00:27.613
named for the payroll app.

10
00:00:27.613 --> 00:00:30.891
The delegated managed account
gets no retriever entry,

11
00:00:30.891 --> 00:00:33.860
because it learns its
hosts during its migration.
